	measure Disclaimer =
			
			"⚠ Not a price forecast — shows crude oil's historical, isolated contribution to fuel prices only. Other factors (taxes, margin, ETS, retailer discounts) can move independently and aren't captured here. MBIE data updates weekly with a reporting lag; recent weeks may still be revised."
